ated, rapidly progressive disease. Mechanistic insight: transient engraftment; baseline myeloid-dominant environment/high IL-8 correlated with poor outcomes, while activated T-cell signatures were favorable, reflecting host state rather than FMT-induced changes.\n    - Contrast with Phase I single-arm (MIMIC): In treatment-naive melanoma, healthy donor FMT + anti-PD1 yielded high response/survival (ORR 65%, mPFS 29.6 mo), suggesting timing (first-line vs refractory) and donor type (healthy vs ICI-responder) critically influence outcomes.\n    - Synthesize for the question: The accumulated data up to 2026 remain at Phase I/IIa stages. Efficacy appears highly context-dependent (treatment line, cancer type, donor source, disease progression speed), and reliable biomarkers for patient selection are still lacking. Thus, the specific request for a completed Phase III RCT confirming efficacy is not met by current literature; existing trials serve as hypothesis-generating or proof-of-concept studies requiring larger, definitive Phase III validation.\n    - Ensure tone matches constraints: No causal overreach, clear distinction between studies, ends with the distinction/status regarding Phase III.\n\n    Draft structure:\n    现有证据均处于早期临床阶段（I期至IIa期），尚未有已完成的大规模III期随机对照试验证实微生物组干预在ICI治疗患者中的确切疗效。不同研究阶段的发现呈现显著差异：在ICI耐药实体瘤的单臂IIa期试验（MITRIC）中，FMT未产生客观缓解（ORR 0%），中位PFS仅1.5个月，机制分析提示供体菌群定植多为短暂性，且基线髓系优势环境（高CD14+单核细胞）和高血清IL-8水平与较差预后相关，而活化T细胞特征则反映宿主原有免疫状态而非FMT的直接干预效果。相比之下，针对初治转移性肾细胞癌的随机双盲IIa期试验（TACITO）显示FMT联合一线治疗虽未达到12个月PFS率的主要终点（d-FMT 70% vs p-FMT 41%，P=0.053），但显著延长了中位PFS（24.0个月 vs 9.0个月），并观察到特定菌株（如Blautia wexlerae）获得与生存获益关联，提示干预时机（一线vs耐药）和供体匹配度可能决定临床信号强弱。而在初治黑色素瘤的单臂I期试验（MIMIC）中，健康供体FMT联合抗PD-1疗法展现出较高的缓解率（65%）与较长的生存期（mPFS 29.6个月），进一步印证了疾病负荷、既往治疗史及供体来源对疗效的调节作用。总体而言，当前微生物组干预的疗效高度依赖具体癌种、治疗线数、供体筛选标准及患者基础免疫微环境，现有数据主要用于生成假设和探索机制边界，尚不足以替代大规模III期RCT作为确证性证据；未来需通过严格设计的III期试验结合可靠生物标志物，明确FMT或菌群制剂在特定人群中的因果效应与适用边界。\n\n    Check against constraints:\n    - Starts with distinguishing findings? Yes.\n    - Ends with distinctions? Yes.\n    - No merging different objects into one universal mechanism? Yes, clearly separates contexts.\n    - Numbers handled correctly? Explained in text, not repeated/rearranged.\n    - Decision logic? Directly addresses the question. Since materials explicitly state only Phase I/IIa exist and Phase III is pending/unmet, `decision` = `direct_use` (足以回答当前问题，或有明确材料纠正其错误前提). The question asks \"是否存在...\", materials say no. So direct_use is appropriate. I will note that materials explicitly confirm the absence of completed Phase III RCTs.\n    - `still_missing`: 明确指出现有文献截至2026年尚无符合“已完成、大规模、III期、随机对照”标准的临床试验数据。\n    - `read_focus`: 无需额外补读，现有材料已完整覆盖该问题的判定依据。\n    - `external_ask`: 若需追踪2026年后是否有新获批或公布的III期RCT，需检索最新临床试验注册库（ClinicalTrials.gov）及肿瘤学顶刊更新。\n    - `reason`: 提供的材料均为I期或IIa期研究（MIMIC为I期单臂，MITRIC与TACITO为IIa期），且作者均在讨论部分明确指出目前缺乏III期确证性数据，现有结果属于探索性或假设生成阶段。材料直接否定了问题预设的“已完成III期RCT”前提，故可直接作答。\n\n    Refine `quantitative_comparisons` format to strictly match instruction:\n    ```json\n    \"quantitative_comparisons\": [\n      {\n  \"research_object\": \"TACITO试验(mRCC一线治疗)\",\n  \"result_or_measure\": \"12个月无进展生存率\",\n  \"setting_or_time\": \"随机双盲安慰剂对照IIa期试验，随机化后12个月\",\n  \"groups\": [\n    {\n      \"group\": \"d-FMT\",\n      \"value\": \"70%\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"group\": \"p-FMT\",\n      \"value\": \"41%\"\n    }\n  ]\n},\n      ...\n    ]\n    ```\n    Wait, instruction says: \"每组写 research_object、result_or_measure、setting_or_time、groups；groups 是 [{group:原文组名或缩写,value:紧邻该组的结果含单位}]\". I'll follow exactly.\n    Also need `group_definitions`.\n    And `reported_statistics`.\n\n    Let's assemble carefully.\n    Check `decision`: The prompt says \"对于“是否已经有某类研究/结果”的问题，找到一个符合条件的实例可以回答；几篇论文未提到，或一篇较早综述说当时没有，不能回答当前是否存在。已有内容可以说明截至该来源时间的研究格局；若仍需确认后来是否出现目标研究，就选择 external_research 并提出该项具体检索，不要一边宣布",
